  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Secondment of a Senior Programme Specialist (P5) to SC/HYD</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Secondment by the Ministry of Environment of the Republic of Korea (RoK) of a Senior Programme Specialist who will support UNESCO activities in water sciences and in particular the thematic area of Hydrological systems, climate change and Adaptation. The secondee will provide guidance in the thematic area, enhance cooperation with RoK and MoE and be responsible for the implementation of a project on Climate Change and Water Security. In particular, in the development of policies and countermeasures to support Member States to reduce their water sector&apos;s vulnerability to climate change and strengthen their human resources capacities.</narrative>
  </description>
